  "releaseNotes": "v3.0 — Async-first IDriver redesign; ReadResult/WriteResult/ControlResult structured results (WriteResult is zero-allocation struct); ITransport unified transport layer (serial/TCP/UDP/HTTP); IoTException + IoTErrorCode 3-segment error codes; DataQuality (OPC UA style); ThingSpec thing model with PropertySpec/EventSpec/ServiceSpec.  v3.0 — IDriver全异步化重构；ReadResult/WriteResult/ControlResult结构化结果；ITransport统一传输层；IoTException+IoTErrorCode三段错误码；DataQuality质量码；ThingSpec物模型。",
